Error [E0160]: this value can't be incremented or decremented
  --> tests/ui/incr_not_lvalue.jet:3:13
    |
  3 |     print(++(n + 1))
    |             ^^^^^^^
 Why: only a mutable name or field like `count` or `self.hits` accepts `++`/`--`
 Fix: use a `:=` binding and write `name += 1` / `name -= 1`
